@startgantt

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam DefaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #14507A
skinparam roundCorner 6

printscale weekly
Project starts 2026-02-16
[Etude et analyse des besoins] as [P1] lasts 3 weeks
[P1] is colored in #1B6CA8/#EAF3FA
[Conception] as [P2] lasts 3 weeks
[P2] starts at [P1]'s end
[Realisation de l'application] as [P3] lasts 5 weeks
[P3] starts at [P2]'s end
[Volet decisionnel (ETL, tableau de bord, Power BI)] as [P4] lasts 3 weeks
[P4] starts at [P3]'s end
[P4] is colored in #C8861A/#FFF3DC
[Segmentation des agences (clustering)] as [P5] lasts 2 weeks
[P5] starts at [P4]'s end
[P5] is colored in #2E7D32/#E8F5E9
[Tests et redaction du rapport] as [P6] lasts 2 weeks
[P6] starts at [P5]'s end
@endgantt
